WEBVTT

01:00:06.302 --> 01:00:08.178
Buzz? What are you doin'?
I thought you were...

01:00:08.263 --> 01:00:11.306
Come on, Sheriff. There's a kid
over in that house who needs us.

01:00:11.391 --> 01:00:13.350
Now let's get
you out of this thing.

01:00:13.434 --> 01:00:14.810
Yes, sir!

01:00:17.397 --> 01:00:19.523
Come on, Buzz.
We can do it.

01:00:25.571 --> 01:00:27.322
Woody, it's the moving van.

01:00:27.407 --> 01:00:29.574
We gotta get outta here now.
